    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d59">

                <pb facs="0061" n="55" sameAs="frus:frus1901China/pg55"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Conger to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 475.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Peking, China</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-12-12"><hi rendition="#italic">December 12,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to my dispatch No. 461, of
                    November 30 last, with reference to the removal of General Tung Fu-hsiang with
                    his baneful influence and inordinate power, from the immediate Vicinity and
                    control of the court, I have the honor to inclose herewith translation of a
                    communication received from Prince Ching and Li Hung-chang, embodying an
                    Imperial decree ordering him to Kansuh; and disbanding 5,500 of his troops.</p>
                <p>There is in this action a pretense of punishment, but it can in nowise be
                    accepted as commensurate with his offense. If, however, the decree is carried
                    out and he and his troops are removed, the court <pb facs="0062" n="56"
                        xml:id="pg56"/> will be left free to punish other criminals, and to return,
                    in due time, without hindrance, to Peking. Severer punishment for General Tung
                    Fu-hsiang may be opportunely demanded a little later on.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">E. H. Conger.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d59-a1.xml" xpointer="d59-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
